      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-29T19:21:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Another TZL question:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was playing a practice round in the Temple, getting ready for the weekly one-shot. &nbsp;One of the Apprentice Poisoners was out, and Fixer hit her with the Hoist Chain, killing her. &nbsp;On the card, her damage is not irreducible, so the Hoist Chain should have reduced the 1 HP damage she did on her death ...but it didn't. &nbsp;She did the full 1 HP of damage to everyone. &nbsp;Is this a bug, or is there something weird about the way the Poisoner works?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:26.231Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
