      "created_at": "2016-11-29T22:31:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I suspect what's happening is that Fixer hits Posioner -&gt; Poisoner is destroyed -&gt; Posioner triggers, dealing one to each non-environment target -&gt; Debuff from Hoist Chain gets applied. &nbsp;Whether or not this is intended behavior I'm uncertain.</p>",
