      "created_at": "2016-11-30T00:02:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It definitely shouldn’t. With similar targets (Ambuscade’s Mine) and effects (Throat Jab, Stun Bolts, etc.) it applies before it’s destroyed. Damage has to happen before destruction, because the damage CAUSED the destruction.</p>\n<p>Has to be a bug.</p>",
