      "created_at": "2016-11-30T00:11:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmmm…it doesn’t seem to be consistent.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Damage has to happen before destruction, because the damage CAUSED the destruction.</p>\n<p>Has to be a bug.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Except that we know that this isn’t true, if it were, Cryo Bot would be able to hit things before being destroyed.</p>",
