      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-30T00:27:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a difference in wording between Sonic Mine and Apprentice Poisoner.</p><p>Sonic Mine: When this card is destroyed, it deals each hero target 2 Sonic damage.</p><p>Apprentice Poisoner: When this card is destroyed, it first deals each non-environment target 1 Toxic damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't see how the inclusion of the word 'first' would change the order of events so that damage reduction works on one but not the other, though.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:11:06.769Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
