      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-01T01:09:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That is a really pedantic correction. The fact of the matter is, it has to take damage before it is destroyed, so any outside \"when it takes damage\" effects must trigger before ITS \"when it's destroyed\" text goes off. We aren't talking about Cryo Bot type effects here. Those are completely irrelevant.</p><p>The point is, Hypersonic has the EXACT same wording as Hoist chain. If Hypersonic works, then so should it.</p><p>I still say that it's a bug, or at least an error.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
